---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-magic-gradient mb-8">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <div class="rich-text text-text-secondary space-y-6">
          <p>
            The Pauper Duel Commander website respects your privacy. This page describes
            the data we collect and how it is used.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary mt-8">Data Collection</h2>
          <p>
            This is a static website. We do not collect any personal data directly.
            No user account is required to browse the site.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary mt-8">Google Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            We use Google Analytics (GA4) to analyze site traffic. Google Analytics uses
            cookies to collect anonymous information about how visitors use the site.
            This information is used to improve content and user experience.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary mt-8">Scryfall API</h2>
          <p>
            Card images and Magic: The Gathering data come from the Scryfall API.
            Using the deck validator sends card names to the Scryfall API for verification.
            No personal data is transmitted to Scryfall.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary mt-8">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For any privacy-related questions, please contact us through the PDC community
            Discord server.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
